Subject: [selfhost 004] PositionQuery imports a module that does not exist

`import AST::ParentRef::*` names no file (R011E): ParentRef and ParentKind
live in AST::Context::TranslationUnit, which the file already imports.
Stage 0 never resolved the import (nothing imports PositionQuery, and its
unity build does not check it). The real fix is deleting the line in main.

diff --git a/Compiler/AST/Matcher/PositionQuery.k b/Compiler/AST/Matcher/PositionQuery.k
--- a/Compiler/AST/Matcher/PositionQuery.k
+++ b/Compiler/AST/Matcher/PositionQuery.k
@@ -16,7 +16,6 @@
 import Location::SourceRange::*;
 import AST::Node::Base::*;
 import AST::Context::TranslationUnit::*;
-import AST::ParentRef::*;
 
 class PositionQuery {
     /// Finds the innermost node covering `loc` in `tu`.
